Supported events

For a list of all actions, visit the Actions
 section of the Flex UI 1.x.x API Reference. All event names take the name of the Action, prefixed with before or after. Every event name is also in camel case.

before[eventName] (for example "beforeAcceptTask")
Called when a named action is triggered, but before the action body is run. You can abort the action that's provided with event body.

after[eventName]
Called after the action has stopped executing.

(information)
Info

The afterLogout event isn't supported. When a worker logs out, they return to the Flex login screen.

